OL,3,AEmployers are being asked to give
OL,4,Ainterview feedback - here's what
OL,5,Aapplicants want
OL,6,
OL,7,FHave you ever applied for a job or
OL,8,Fattended an interview, only to hear
OL,9,Fabsolutely nothing back from the
OL,10,Femployer?
OL,12,FSo-called "job ghosting" has become a
OL,13,Fbig problem for jobseekers in the UK,
OL,14,Fleaving them "demoralised", denting
OL,15,Ftheir confidence and undermining their
OL,16,Fhopes of finding work.
OL,18,FIt's an issue that was mentioned in
OL,19,Fformer minister Alan Milburn's major
OL,20,Freview into young people who are not in
OL,21,Femployment, education or training -
OL,22,Fthose dubbed as Neets - this week.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,108,105,200,300,0,100
